# Sprint C0 orchestration logs / A2A bus (ephemeral)
.sprint/

# No tracked Cargo.lock (fleet rule). A lock is only ever permitted to freeze
# EXTERNAL dependencies, and a Cargo.lock freezes everything — so tracking one
# silently converts every floating internal dep into a rev pin. Measured on the
# lock removed in this commit: `Cargo.toml` asked for
# `ruff = { git = ..., branch = "main" }` while the lock held
# `1fa73b939cad65706f09502c2374ced664f8f8d9` — the BASE of ruff PR #73, i.e.
# before the whole Klickwege arc (#73-#88) the pipeline depends on. OGAR was
# frozen at 90ba79f6 and lance-graph at 5284755c the same way.
# Internal deps float on their branch; external pins live in Cargo.toml.
Cargo.lock
